  "ingredients": [
    "0.5 cup butter, cut into cubes",
    "3 baking potatoes, peeled and cut into cubes",
    "1 small onion, diced",
    "1.5 teaspoons ground black pepper",
    "3 cups whole milk",
    "6 cups water",
    "2 tablespoons chicken bouillon",
    "1.5 cups all-purpose flour",
    "7 tablespoons whole milk, or more as needed",
    "1 egg, beaten",
    "2 teaspoons dill weed",
    "2 teaspoons parsley",
    "1 teaspoon ground black pepper",
    "0.5 teaspoon salt"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather the ingredients.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/VwBodwwerDtzHFFLZavbFqKK3VY=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/235753-knoephla-soup-DDMFS-step01-74ad6131e3384fbfb2e3de6a11000737.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/235753/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Make soup: Melt butter in a large skillet over medium heat. Sauté potatoes, onion, and pepper in hot butter until just tender, about 20 minutes. Stir in milk and heat until almost boiling, about 5 minutes. Remove the skillet from heat.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/IdGCKqMQD-Lgtx7AO1BYPnJQrQo=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/235753-knoephla-soup-DDMFS-step02-7dacefcedbe44c538f9336aa405e3b0d.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/235753/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bring water and chicken bouillon to a boil in a Dutch oven or heavy pot.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/srmsX-bixfGy7mjklq-JRP-V3vw=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/235753-knoephla-soup-DDMFS-step03-31d22124d70c4b63a8f26f4c3aee0444.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/235753/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Make knoephla: Mix together flour, milk, beaten egg, dill weed, parsley, pepper, and salt in a bowl until dough is stiff. Add more milk, 1 tablespoon at a time, if needed.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/YH2tPfj3hRobqyrC6CCyJSdEgF0=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/235753-knoephla-soup-DDMFS-step04-4aca3db1fb9248989603c305b1ffbefa.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/235753/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Roll dough into ropes about 1/2-inch thick on a work surface. Cut ropes into 1/4-inch pieces and drop them into boiling broth.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/tvX4nfiukwBh3iFC2HBY7uaTWOs=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/235753-knoephla-soup-DDMFS-step05-bad069e4baad4668aac7ae48a9adf6d5.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/235753/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Reduce heat, cover the Dutch oven with a lid, and simmer until knoephla begin to float, about 10 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/zgu-j7AeV_oJ09erYvI-o3xG738=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/235753-knoephla-soup-DDMFS-step06-4771c6b4ff074ae48b667ad1e5cdfbbf.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/235753/step_06.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Stir potato mixture into broth and knoephla; simmer until potatoes are tender, about 20 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/ceOS7MGNadovY_xTEHQQezX8KsQ=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/235753-knoephla-soup-DDMFS-step07-1106e01419444a80a5753c8d21d5f1f3.jpg"
      ],
